      "sequence_position": 8,
      "problem": "Maria has a bank account at LJB Bank. She has an overdraft facility authorized by this bank. Her bank balance on Monday was $-$40.00.$ To reduce her debt, Maria decides to make a deposit of $$18.60$ into her bank account on the following Tuesday. What is Maria's balance at the end of the day on Tuesday?",
      "worked_solution": "To determine the balance at the end of the day on Tuesday, we must add the amount of money Maria deposited to the starting balance. This gives\n\n$$\n-$40.00+$18.60=-$21.40.\n$$\n\nThus, Maria's balance at the end of the day on Tuesday is $-$21.40.$",
